[108.260432, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[108.313314, "o", ".github/workflows/m17-security-evals.yml: its key lines, with their line numbers.\r\nHidden here: the comments, and the concurrency, timeout, folder, env and artifact settings. Open the file for all of it.\r\n\r\n  1  name: m17-security-evals\r\n 13  on:\r\n 14    push:\r\n 15      paths: [\"labs/m17/**\", \".github/workflows/m17-security-evals.yml\"]\r\n 16    pull_request:\r\n 17      paths: [\"labs/m17/**\", \".github/workflows/m17-security-evals.yml\"]\r\n 18    workflow_dispatch:\r\n 20  permissions:\r\n 21    contents: read\r\n 27  jobs:\r\n 28    security-evals:\r\n"]
[108.313384, "o", " 29      name: security evals (TSG Helpdesk)\r\n 30      runs-on: ubuntu-24.04\r\n 38      steps:\r\n 39        - uses: actions/checkout@3d3c42e5aac5ba805825da76410c181273ba90b1 # v7.0.1\r\n 41            persist-credentials: false\r\n 43        - uses: actions/setup-node@949feb2413d6458794dcd2491c4babbbce0c15c1 # v7.1.0\r\n 45            node-version: \"22.22.0\"\r\n"]
[108.313546, "o", " 47        - name: Pipeline rules (pinned actions, read-only token, evals talk only to 127.0.0.1)\r\n 48          run: python3 -m unittest test_lab.T4_Safety\r\n 50        - name: Security evals on the hardened build (every test must pass)\r\n 51          run: python3 run_eval.py --out results/hardened.json --junit results/hardened.junit.xml\r\n 53        - name: Negative control on the weak build (the suite must fail)\r\n 54          run: python3 run_eval.py --profile weak --expect-fail --out results/weak.json\r\n 56        - name: Keep the evidence\r\n 57          if: always()\r\n 58          uses: actions/upload-artifact@cf430e030ddbb5b0abf93d22962f4752f3646cd9 # v7.0.2\r\n\r\nEach `run:` line is a shell command on a fresh GitHub machine. A command that exits with a code other than 0\r\nfails its step, and a failed step fails the job: the pull request gets a red check. `make ci` runs the same three.\r\n"]
[108.321046, "o", "\u001b[?2004h\u001b]0;thesecguy@lab: ~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m17\u0007\u001b[01;32mthesecguy@lab\u001b[00m:\u001b[01;34m~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m17\u001b[00m$ "]
